stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SUBMITTED: applicant submits form + >=3 documents
    SUBMITTED --> EXTRACTING: extraction service + rules engine
    EXTRACTING --> AUTO_APPROVED: APPROVE and risk LOW/MEDIUM
    EXTRACTING --> PENDING_CHECKER: APPROVE and risk HIGH
    EXTRACTING --> IN_REVIEW: REVIEW (R1-R3, R11-R17)
    EXTRACTING --> AUTO_REJECTED: REJECT (R4-R10)
    IN_REVIEW --> PENDING_CHECKER: maker recommends APPROVE / REJECT
    IN_REVIEW --> RESUBMISSION_REQUESTED: maker requests new documents
    RESUBMISSION_REQUESTED --> SUBMITTED: applicant re-uploads (within 7 days)
    RESUBMISSION_REQUESTED --> CLOSED_EXPIRED: no resubmission in 7 days
    PENDING_CHECKER --> APPROVED: checker (different user) approves
    PENDING_CHECKER --> REJECTED: checker rejects
    PENDING_CHECKER --> IN_REVIEW: checker sends back
    AUTO_APPROVED --> [*]: account opened (mock core banking)
    APPROVED --> [*]: account opened (mock core banking)
    AUTO_REJECTED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CLOSED_EXPIRED --> [*]
